{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103700","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710370001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FB68F0FACB0085","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","variant_male_record_index":"224597","variant_female_record_index":"224598","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1710370001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，我、我真的回来了？佩吉呢？！你们看到佩吉了吗？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FB68F0FACB0085","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 저, 저 돌아온 건가요? 페기는요? 페기 보셨어요?","variant_male_record_index":"224597","variant_female_record_index":"224598","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710370002:1":{"text":"저만요?! 아니... 페기는 방금 제 뒤에 있었어요! 칼리번을 뽑으려고 했지만 실패했죠...","source_cn":"只有我？！不……佩吉刚刚就在我身后的，她试着去拔那柄石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC2CC2A4A70D815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1710370002":{"text":"저만요?! 아니... 페기는 방금 제 뒤에 있었어요! 칼리번을 뽑으려고 했지만 실패했죠...","source_cn":"只有我？！不……佩吉刚刚就在我身后的，她试着去拔那柄石中剑，但是失败了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC2CC2A4A70D815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710370003:1":{"text":"잠시만요. 진정 좀 할게요... 휴... 그게 어떻게 된 거냐면요...","source_cn":"让我冷静一下——呼，事情是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0D94E9DA0610AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710370004:1":{"text":"갑자기 마물의 습격을 받았어요. 다들 필사적으로 저항했지만, 결국 속수무책으로 궁지에 몰리고 말았어요...","source_cn":"我们突然遭遇了魔物袭击，大家奋力抵抗，但还是被逼的后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FB386C28FD76B08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710370005:1":{"text":"그때 페기는 모두를 구하기 위해서 칼리번을 뽑으려고 했지만 실패했고...","source_cn":"佩吉为了保护大家，跑去拔剑，但是没有成功……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA7E6F2729050734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710370006:1":{"text":"그렇게, 몰려오는 마물 때문에 죽는 줄 알았어요. 그런데... 그 순간 칼리번이 갑자기 스스로 움직이더라고요!","source_cn":"然后魔物冲了过来，我以为我们要死了……可那把石中剑自己动了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7123C80FFCF70993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710370007:1":{"text":"그리고 공중으로 떠올라, 성스러운 빛을 따뜻하게 내뿜는 걸 제가 직접 봤어요!","source_cn":"我亲眼看见那柄石中剑自己漂浮在了空中，爆发出一阵温暖的圣光！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0249CE7930DEE03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710370008:1":{"text":"마물들은 그 빛 속에서 사라졌고요...","source_cn":"接着那些魔物就在光芒中消失了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1F87BA1D178706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710370009:1":{"text":"그리고, 여기로 돌아온 거예요!","source_cn":"再然后，我就在这里了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD33DD3B3A17581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1710370009":{"text":"그리고, 여기로 돌아온 거예요!","source_cn":"再然后，我就在这里了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD33DD3B3A17581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710370010:0":{"text":"공주님께서 칼리번을 뽑지 못하셨지만, 칼리번이 모두를 지키기 위해 스스로 깨어나다니...","source_cn":"佩吉殿下没能拔出剑，剑却为了保护众人而自动觉醒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20D1FB3CB9E5B9CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710370011:1":{"text":"칼리번... 설마 로란 대제님의 영령이 보이지 않는 곳에서 레오프론의 백성들을 지켜주고 계셨던 걸까요?!","source_cn":"石中剑……难道说，真的是罗兰大帝的英灵在冥冥之中庇佑着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE3D3B07BD087320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710370012:1":{"text":"어쨌든 그 빛 덕분에 제가 돌아온 거라면 페기와 카세디아... 그리고 다른 사람들도 돌아오지 않았을까요?","source_cn":"不管是谁显灵，既然那道光把我送回来了，那佩吉和科丝蒂…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6C23CA93861F8A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1710370012":{"text":"어쨌든 그 빛 덕분에 제가 돌아온 거라면 페기와 카세디아... 그리고 다른 사람들도 돌아오지 않았을까요?","source_cn":"不管是谁显灵，既然那道光把我送回来了，那佩吉和科丝蒂……还有亨德里克司令他们，会不会也回来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6C23CA93861F8A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710370013:1":{"text":"아, 고대의 전당! 고대의 전당도 광장에 돌아왔을지 몰라요. 그럼 페기도 돌아왔겠죠!","source_cn":"对！圣古堂！说不定圣古堂已经回到了广场上！那佩吉肯定也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x303441489E479842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710370014:1":{"text":"아버지께서 돌아오셨다면 분명 광장의 질서부터 정리하셨을 거예요. 어서 고대의 전당으로 가서 확인해 보죠!","source_cn":"父亲如果回来了，一定会第一时间整顿广场秩序。事不宜迟，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA716FB44F4DE964A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"고대의 전당도 돌아왔을 거야","source_cn":"圣古堂可能也回来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh